{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>ואמרתם, מתלאה</b> — deficient heh, like מזה בידך מה זאת התלאה, on account of the curse there is no bread at all on the table." "<b>והפחתם אותו</b> — for it is like פיח (soot), and there is not enough of it." "<b>והבאתם</b> — behold, the table is empty, and upon the altar is a grain-offering; it is not as I desired."], :book :malachi, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Malachi -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/malachi"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:09.494704611Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}